            <profile id="46a9-f502-b466-5115" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Noble has a hand weapon, light armour and shield. May have throwing spear (+2), composite bow (+4), javelins (+2) or two-handed axe (+3). May ride a horse (+9), or count as Riding Horses (+1). One Noble with no additional weapons may be upgraded to Army Standard Bearer (+25).</characteristic>
