                </conditions>
              </modifier>
              </modifiers>
            </profile>
            <profile id="5d16-abb6-59e2-3887" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A Berserker has a hand weapon and shield. May have light armour (+2), throwing spear (+2), javelins (+1) or two-handed axe (+3). May ride a horse (+9), or count as Riding Horses (+1). Up to three Berserkers may be included in a unit of Hirdmen. Enemy models in base-to-base contact with a Berserker must fight against him. Second rank supports directly in front of the Berserker MUST fight him, but adjacent supports may attack any valid target. Excess wounds on Berserkers do not count towards combat resolution and are lost.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="15a4-9f6a-134c-05c8" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
